<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Yokai henge mo buttobashi</i></font>

22
00:00:52,990 --> 00:00:56,090
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>All the while pounding on mutants and monsters</i></font>

23
00:00:56,090 --> 00:01:02,520
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Kumo no mashin de kyo mo tobu no sa</i></font>

24
00:00:56,090 --> 00:01:02,520
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>And we'll fly through the day</i>
