<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Te ni irero! Doragon Booru</i></font>

34
00:01:21,380 --> 00:01:24,890
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>Let's get them in hand! The Dragon Balls!</i></font>

35
