<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Sekai de itto ikashita dorama</i></font>

40
00:01:31,890 --> 00:01:35,130
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>Some of the most enjoyable drama in the world</i></font>

41
00:01:35,130 --> 00:01:38,600
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Kono yo wa dekkai takarajima</i></font>

42
00:01:35,130 --> 00:01:38,600
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>This life is one big treasure island</i></font>

43
00:01:38,600 --> 00:01:48,370
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>So sa ima koso adobencha!</i></font>

44
00:01:38,600 --> 00:01:48,370
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>It's the truth! Now more than ever, Adventure!</i></font>

45
00:01:59,370 --> 00:02:02,240
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">"Grim Situation!!"</font>

46
00:02:29,340 --> 00:02:32,640
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Y-You!</font>

47
00:02:34,980 --> 00:02:37,550
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">That is enough, Piccolo!</font>

48
00:02:37,550 --> 00:02:40,350
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Goku! I will assist you!</font>

49
00:02:40,350 --> 00:02:42,480
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">We will defeat him together!</font>

50
00:02:42,490 --> 00:02:45,550
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Don't be stupid, God!</font>

51
00:02:47,720 --> 00:02:51,490
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What? What did you just say?!</font>

52
00:02:51,490 --> 00:02:54,900
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Our match still hasn't
come to a conclusion yet!</font>

53
00:02:54,900 --> 00:02:58,370
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Stay out of this! It was just getting good!</font>

54
00:02:58,370 --> 00:03:00,170
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">T-The match, you say?!</font>

55
00:03:01,640 --> 00:03:04,810
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">He's <i>still</i> talkin' about the match!</font>

56
00:03:04,810 --> 00:03:08,570
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">The world's in big trouble if we
don't defeat Piccolo, you know!</font>

57
00:03:10,050 --> 00:03:12,580
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">That's Goku for you.</font>

58
00:03:12,580 --> 00:03:17,550
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">It would seem the world isn't
particularly important in his eyes.</font>

59
00:03:17,550 --> 00:03:22,890
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Beating opponents who are strong
enough to excite him is all he wants.</font>

60
00:03:26,530 --> 00:03:30,600
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Hey. I'll let you hit me as hard
as you were just about to.</font>

61
00:03:30,600 --> 00:03:32,200
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">As I was just about to?</font>

62
00:03:32,200 --> 00:03:36,570
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Yeah. As hard as that punch that
God got in the way of!</font>

63
00:03:38,280 --> 00:03:40,340
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">So come on! Punch me!</font>

64
00:03:40,340 --> 00:03:42,900
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I won't be satisfied if you don't!</font>

65
00:03:44,250 --> 00:03:46,420
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Tryin' to show off, are we?</font>

66
00:03:46,420 --> 00:03:48,540
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Fine, then!</font>

67
00:03:52,120 --> 00:03:53,750
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Goku-<i>san</i>!</font>

68
00:03:57,960 --> 00:03:59,900
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Ow!</font>

69
00:03:59,900 --> 00:04:04,100
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Now things are fair and square...</font>

70
00:04:04,100 --> 00:04:07,540
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">He's stupidly honest...</font>

71
00:04:07,540 --> 00:04:10,230
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">That's what's so good about Goku!</font>

72
00:04:29,730 --> 00:04:33,750
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Finally, it looks like exhaustion
is starting to set in for you...</font>

73
00:04:35,870 --> 00:04:38,970
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">As if you're one to talk...</font>

74
00:04:38,970 --> 00:04:41,630
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">The fire behind your punches is going out!</font>

75
00:04:44,240 --> 00:04:50,180
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Son Goku! Stop with this pretense of
fighting for the sake of the match!</font>

76
00:04:50,180 --> 00:04:56,250
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">We may well live to regret it if the
two of us do not defeat him now!</font>

77
00:04:56,250 --> 00:04:59,890
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I'd regret it even more if I did that!</font>

78
00:04:59,890 --> 00:05:02,360
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I'm sorry, but hear me out!</font>

79
00:05:02,360 --> 00:05:04,520
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">This is about the pride
of being a martial artist!</font>

80
00:05:08,060 --> 00:05:09,360
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">God!</font>

81
00:05:11,000 --> 00:05:13,270
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I, too, implore you.</font>

82
00:05:13,270 --> 00:05:16,710
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Please allow Goku to fight by himself!</font>

83
00:05:16,710 --> 00:05:21,540
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Goku has already saved
this world once before!</font>

84
00:05:29,650 --> 00:05:31,720
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">T-That's right!</font>

85
00:05:31,720 --> 00:05:36,490
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">And if things turn ugly, we can
always team up to take care of him!</font>

86
00:05:38,760 --> 00:05:42,200
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You can always team up
to take care of me?</font>

87
00:05:42,200 --> 00:05:46,740
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Don't make me laugh! Not even 100
of you could stand up against me!</font>

88
00:05:46,740 --> 00:05:49,140
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>Including</i> God, of course.</font>

89
00:05:49,140 --> 00:05:51,010
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">W-What did you say?!</font>

90
00:05:51,010 --> 00:05:53,540
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Yamucha!</font>

91
00:05:53,540 --> 00:05:57,500
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I'm on an entirely different
level than the lot of you!</font>

92
00:06:00,180 --> 00:06:02,050
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">B-But...</font>

93
00:06:03,150 --> 00:06:06,460
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Unfortunate as it may be,
what he says is the truth.</font>

94
00:06:06,460 --> 00:06:12,220
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Goku is the only one now who can
keep up with his remarkable speed.</font>

95
00:06:19,500 --> 00:06:24,410
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">So you imbeciles have
<i>finally</i> figured it out?!</font>

96
00:06:28,340 --> 00:06:30,940
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Very well, Goku.</font>

97
00:06:32,450 --> 00:06:36,150
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I entrust this world to you alone!</font>

98
00:06:36,150 --> 00:06:40,060
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">But in exchange, you <i>must</i>
put an end to Piccolo's life!</font>

99
00:06:40,060 --> 00:06:44,030
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Listen well. When I perish,</font>

100
00:06:44,030 --> 00:06:47,900
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">use the Dragon Balls to
bring me back to life.</font>

101
00:06:49,800 --> 00:06:51,600
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Right! Leave it to me!</font>

102
00:06:51,600 --> 00:06:53,900
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I'm confident I can beat him!</font>

103
00:06:56,470 --> 00:07:01,270
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You say you're confident you can beat me?</font>

104
00:07:02,680 --> 00:07:06,450
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What a load of crap!</font>

105
00:07:06,450 --> 00:07:08,780
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">It isn't crap at all!</font>

106
00:07:08,790 --> 00:07:11,220
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I've seen enough of your techniques!</font>

107
00:07:11,220 --> 00:07:14,090
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">W-What?!</font>

108
00:07:14,090 --> 00:07:17,360
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You've seen enough of my techniques?!</font>

109
00:07:17,360 --> 00:07:20,030
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>Son Goku, huh?</i></font>

110
00:07:20,030 --> 00:07:23,000
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>What a completely mystifying person he is...</i></font>

111
00:07:23,000 --> 00:07:25,900
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>His strength knows no end!</i></font>

112
00:07:25,900 --> 00:07:32,070
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>Each time he battles a powerful</i>
<i>opponent, he grows ever stronger!</i></font>

113
00:07:32,080 --> 00:07:38,410
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>His strength had grown far beyond</i>
<i>my own before I had even realized it.</i></font>

114
00:07:38,410 --> 00:07:42,150
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>He may indeed be able to win!</i></font>

115
00:07:45,960 --> 00:07:49,480
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You can beat <i>me</i>, Piccolo Daimao?!</font>

116
00:07:50,490 --> 00:07:52,830
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>You</i> can beat <i>me</i>?!</font>

117
00:07:54,960 --> 00:07:57,470
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I can!</font>

118
00:07:57,470 --> 00:08:00,500
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Absurd! There is no possible
way for you to beat me!</font>

119
00:08:00,500 --> 00:08:08,780
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">My power is many times greater than it
was when I fought you three years ago!</font>

120
00:08:08,780 --> 00:08:14,340
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>I've</i> grown just a little bit
stronger than that, then!</font>

121
00:08:16,550 --> 00:08:18,680
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Nonsense!</font>

122
00:08:22,560 --> 00:08:25,360
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Why're you doing an
attack like that <i>now</i>?!</font>

123
00:08:42,580 --> 00:08:48,520
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>Kamehameha!</i></font>

124
00:08:49,820 --> 00:08:51,520
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">It's useless, no matter <i>how</i> much you run!</font>

125
00:08:51,520 --> 00:08:54,180
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">It'll keep following you wherever you go!</font>

126
00:08:57,230 --> 00:08:59,090
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Oh, yeah?</font>

127
00:09:06,270 --> 00:09:07,760
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What's he planning to do?!</font>

128
00:09:09,410 --> 00:09:11,270
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Given up, have you?!</font>

129
00:09:41,600 --> 00:09:44,140
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">W-What happened to Goku?!</font>

130
00:09:44,140 --> 00:09:48,240
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">He looks like he's all right.</font>

131
00:10:05,430 --> 00:10:10,030
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">He did it... He severely
damaged one of Piccolo's arms!</font>

132
00:10:10,030 --> 00:10:14,630
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Goku came up with that plan
right there on the spot?!</font>

133
00:10:25,110 --> 00:10:29,810
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Give up! You can't fight anymore
with your arm like that!</font>

134
00:11:13,390 --> 00:11:15,930
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You'll pay for that!</font>

135
00:11:15,930 --> 00:11:20,800
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">That you would drive me this far!</font>

136
00:11:22,430 --> 00:11:28,270
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Take this! Piccolo Daimao-<i>sama</i>'s last resort!</font>

137
00:12:06,380 --> 00:12:10,050
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Get out of here!</font>

138
00:12:10,050 --> 00:12:12,520
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Run away! Hurry!</font>

139
00:12:14,350 --> 00:12:20,280
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Everyone! Get away from here right now!</font>

140
00:12:26,840 --> 00:12:30,310
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>W-What tremendous ki energy!</i></font>

141
00:12:30,310 --> 00:12:33,810
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>I've never felt power this intense before!</i></font>

142
00:12:39,700 --> 00:12:44,320
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>This really must be his last resort!</i></font>

143
00:12:55,030 --> 00:13:00,220
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">T-This is not good! Not good at all!</font>

144
00:13:01,800 --> 00:13:08,070
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Ma-Junior appears to be concentrating
a massive amount of energy!</font>

145
00:13:08,070 --> 00:13:11,840
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What will happen next?!
I have absolutely no idea!</font>

146
00:13:11,840 --> 00:13:14,840
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">This isn't the time to be
doing the play-by-play!</font>

147
00:13:14,850 --> 00:13:17,810
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What are you guys doing?!</font>

148
00:13:17,820 --> 00:13:19,850
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I told you to get out of here!</font>

149
00:13:19,850 --> 00:13:22,550
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Run! Hurry!</font>

150
00:13:22,550 --> 00:13:24,050
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">As far away as you can!</font>

151
00:13:24,050 --> 00:13:27,320
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Get off this island!</font>

152
00:13:30,360 --> 00:13:34,200
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Goku-<i>san</i>! What are you
planning on doing?!</font>

153
00:13:34,200 --> 00:13:36,700
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I'm...</font>

154
00:13:36,700 --> 00:13:39,000
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">...going to withstand it!</font>

155
00:13:42,510 --> 00:13:44,440
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Such imprudence! Don't be a fool!</font>

156
00:13:44,440 --> 00:13:47,440
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Do you intend to remain
obstinate to the end?!</font>

157
00:13:47,440 --> 00:13:51,050
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">This is no longer a match!</font>

158
00:13:51,050 --> 00:13:53,080
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Let us both flee together!</font>

159
00:13:53,080 --> 00:13:55,180
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Escape at once!</font>

160
00:15:01,250 --> 00:15:03,950
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">L-Look! His body!</font>

161
00:15:24,640 --> 00:15:27,940
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Dammit! This doesn't look good!</font>

162
00:15:29,580 --> 00:15:32,640
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>Kikouhou!</i></font>

163
00:15:38,490 --> 00:15:39,660
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Everyone!</font>

164
00:15:39,660 --> 00:15:42,660
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">If you don't wanna die,
then get inside this hole!</font>

165
00:15:42,660 --> 00:15:45,490
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Stop worrying Goku!</font>

166
